xpected_failure": "called `Result::unwrap_err()` on an `Ok` value", "expected_failure_match": true, "failure": "test_scalar_div_rem_zero panicked: called `Result::unwrap_err()` on an `Ok` value: 0", "fixed_commit": "5dcf2a1deb1b8e2e225521cb103ee90a8c70b666", "fixed_tree": "5e0de7c493b264c0870b0006dcf4d0760b238234", "fixes": [{"commit": "5dcf2a1deb1b8e2e225521cb103ee90a8c70b666", "parent": "d1e4498cbc02d22b3ddded7216c38d94e494cf90"}], "patch": "patches/5dcf2a1deb1b8e2e225521cb103ee90a8c70b666-1/20260924T005217Z-412b6be2.patch", "provenance": "verbatim", "restored_source_matches": true, "runs": {"buggy": {"exit_code": 101, "log": "evidence/5dcf2a1deb1b8e2e225521cb103ee90a8c70b666-1/20260924T005217Z-412b6be2/buggy.log", "named_result": "FAILED", "tests_run": 1, "timed_out": false}, "fixed": {"exit_code": 0, "log": "evidence/5dcf2a1deb1b8e2e225521cb103ee90a8c70b666-1/20260924T005217Z-412b6be2/fixed.log", "named_result": "ok", "tests_run": 1, "timed_out": false}, "restored": {"exit_code": 0, "log": "evidence/5dcf2a1deb1b8e2e225521cb103ee90a8c70b666-1/20260924T005217Z-412b6be2/restored.log", "named_result": "ok", "tests_run": 1, "timed_out": false}}, "signature": "called `Result::unwrap_err()` on an `Ok` value: 0", "test_sources": [{"commit": "5dcf2a1deb1b8e2e225521cb103ee90a8c70b666", "paths": ["src/biguint/division.rs"]}], "tests": ["test_scalar_div_rem_zero"]}, "shard": "num-bigint", "status": "confirmed", "subject": "Fix scalar divide-by-zero panics", "summary": "BigUint::zero() / 0u32 returned zero without panicking because the empty digit vector skipped all division operations. The fix checks for a zero divisor before iterating. Reversing only this guard restores the division bug. The fix-added test_scalar_div_rem_zero in tests/biguint_scalar.rs detects it when catch_unwind returns Ok instead of the expected panic.", "updated_at": "2026-09-24T00:53:44.813802+00:00"}
{"commit": "3b13d9a20e649c928282f88531af8a07f03ef092", "id": "3b13d9a20e649c928282f88531af8a07f03ef092-1", "language": "rust", "reason": "Proposal names no upstream test", "repo": "https://github.com/rust-num/num-bigint", "reproduction": {"attempt": "20260925T172000Z-a3608166", "evidence_sha256": {"evidence/3b13d9a20e649c928282f88531af8a07f03ef092-1/20260925T172000Z-a3608166/origin.json": "8f91dd7c41fee1862be9b8b1ea5b0d32aa74bdcc06130c18a15bf3d9c458478c", "evidence/3b13d9a20e649c928282f88531af8a07f03ef092-1/20260925T172000Z-a3608166/proposal.json": "6f0203d7be80e37d4e5385f17d8bd47d744fe8e7ffbbe9632223f7560f446ec7"}, "provenance": "verbatim"}, "shard": "num-bigint", "status": "blocked", "subject": "Fix promotion of negative isize", "summary": "`promote_signed_scalars_assign!` routed the `isize` `AddAssign` impl through `UsizePromotion`, so a negative `isize` was reinterpreted as a huge positive `usize` before addition. The fix routes `isize` through `IsizePromotion`, preserving the sign.", "updated_at": "2026-09-25T17:20:00.671775+00:00"}
